{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00825","headline":"郊庙歌辞 周宗庙乐舞辞 明德舞 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 周宗庙乐舞辞 明德舞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"惟彼岐阳，德大流光。\n载造周室，泽及遐荒。\n於铄圣祖，上帝是皇。\n乃圣乃神，知微知彰。\n新庙奕奕，丰年穰穰。\n取彼血膋，以往蒸尝。\n黍稷惟馨，笾豆大房。\n工祝致告，受福无疆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00825.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00825","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}